sequenceDiagram
    participant Q as Kueue admission check
    participant S as Setu
    participant K as Karpenter and API server
    participant W as Kubernetes scheduler
    Q->>S: Workload awaits admission check
    S->>K: Create required NodeClaims sequentially
    K-->>S: Observe NodeClaim readiness
    alt All required claims ready
        S-->>Q: Mark admission check ready
        Q-->>W: Workload becomes eligible to run
        W->>W: Independently filter, score and bind Pods
    else Failure or timeout
        S->>K: Attempt compensating cleanup
        S-->>Q: Retry or fail under configured policy
    end
